; effect4_bytes — the byte layer of the engine and the CAS: big-endian framing (E4_be, which
; forwards to Eff_frame), hexadecimal (E4_hex),
; and SHA-256 (E4_sha256). It names no engine module, so it sits below the engine and the CAS:
; the CAS needs the engine only for E4_checkpoint. Unwrapped, as effect4_eff and effect4_clock
; are, so the generated engine and the CAS name its modules directly. A sub-library of the
; engine's dune project (ocaml/engine/dune-project), as cas/ is.
(library
 (name effect4_bytes)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries effect4_eff)
 (flags (:standard -w +a-4-9-40-41-42-44-45-70)))
